    {
      "id": "claim_336da95ee09642a3bce0dce1c51dd050",
      "statement": "The Form is authoritative about which products a position uses; a Form product missing from the recipe is a defect, while recipe products absent from the Form are derived detail (connectors, kits) and never flagged as errors.",
